WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Your role.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:07.500
Narrator: Follow the instruction from the control room and Civil Defense, through your supervisor.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:15.500
Narrator: If you're told to shelter fans, guide them calmly to the shelter areas you're given - inner concourses, away from glass.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.400
Narrator: Don't send fans out into open areas on your own.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.400
Narrator: Tents, glass and temporary structures are not shelter - follow the instruction to the designated shelter.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:36.600
Narrator: At the gates, stop or redirect fans only when the control room tells you, with words and directions, never force, and guide them to the nearest shelter.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:43.500
Narrator: If a shelter area is getting full, stop and tell your supervisor - don't push more fans in.
